config CRUX_SYSTEM_NATIVE_SIM_WATCHDOG
    bool "Experimental: simulated Crux System watchdog, native_sim tests only"
    depends on CRUX_SYSTEM
    select NATIVE_SIM_REBOOT if BOARD_NATIVE_SIM
    help
      Experimental (ADR-0001 Decision 4) and for native_sim tests only; not hardware evidence.
      Builds a private simulated watchdog device and binds it as the System watchdog, so a
      native_sim test sees a feed cycle and a missed feed. A missed feed prints one line and
      restarts the simulated process, which then reads the reset cause SOFTWARE, never WATCHDOG.
      Selects NATIVE_SIM_REBOOT for that restart. No board dependency is declared on purpose:
      the component stops the configure step with an error on any board but native_sim, which
      a hidden symbol could not do. Off by default; no public header, target or function is added.

