    depends on FS_FATFS_LFN && FS_FATFS_MAX_LFN >= 127 && FS_FATFS_REENTRANT
    depends on !FS_FATFS_MOUNT_MKFS
    help
      Compile the File implementation and RT1062 SDHC/FatFs composition as an
      object-only check, on any board with the RT1062 SoC and an enabled USDHC with an SD
      disk (on the RT1060-EVK, the Rev B QSPI target). This does not link or select a
